# Radio page tour (day). Demo mode, and the launch default AutoradioDemoSheet = day (defaults write news.choir.autoradio.lab AutoradioDemoSheet day),
# which loads fixtures/demo/runsheet-day.json as the run sheet and keeps the station from starting by itself. @S@ is the shots directory.
# Drags need: agent ios --touch platform.
clock data
clock +1500 real
clock data
tree
screenshot @S@/B01-ready.png window
tap radio-next-all
clock +900 real
clock data
tree
screenshot @S@/B02-all-of-it.png window
tap radio-next-all
clock +900 real
tap radio-next-grip-1 drag 0 70
clock +1200 real
clock data
tree
screenshot @S@/B03-after-drag.png window
tap radio-next-1 drag -160 0
clock +1200 real
clock data
tree
screenshot @S@/B04-after-swipe.png window
tap radio-next-play-0
clock +3500 real
clock data
tree
screenshot @S@/B05-on-air-story.png window
tap radio-why
clock +900 real
clock data
tree
screenshot @S@/B06-why-this.png window
tap radio-place-mail
clock +1500 real
clock data
tree
screenshot @S@/B08-mail-place.png window
tap bar-now
clock +1500 real
clock data
tree
screenshot @S@/B09-back-from-bar-now.png window
tap radio-heard-0
clock +3000 real
clock data
tree
screenshot @S@/B10-replay-from-heard.png window
